<figure id="A1.T5" class="ltx_table">

<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A1.T5.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 5</span>: </span><span id="A1.T5.9" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Multi-step denoising on BEIR-7 (out-of-domain). Per-dataset NDCG@10 plus the BEIR-7 average, at the train-selected <math id="A1.T5.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(K_{q}^{*},K_{p}^{*})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>K</mi><mi>q</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>K</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(K_{q}^{*},K_{p}^{*})</annotation></semantics></math>: Dream <math id="A1.T5.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(4,16)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>16</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(4,16)</annotation></semantics></math>, LLaDA <math id="A1.T5.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(4,4)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(4,4)</annotation></semantics></math>. <math id="A1.T5.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S{=}1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S{=}1</annotation></semantics></math> is the single-pass variant used throughout the main paper; <math id="A1.T5.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S{=}2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S{=}2</annotation></semantics></math> is two-step iterative denoising. Each cell reports Dense (<span id="A1.T5.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">D</span>), Sparse (<span id="A1.T5.9.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">S</span>), and Hybrid (<span id="A1.T5.9.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">H</span>) scores, matching the convention of Table <a href="#S5.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ 5.2 In-domain fine-tuning ‣ 5 Results ‣ DiffRetriever: Parallel Representative Tokens for Retrieval with Diffusion Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>. <span id="A1.T5.9.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Bold</span>: better of the <math id="A1.T5.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S{=}1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S{=}1</annotation></semantics></math> / <math id="A1.T5.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S{=}2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S{=}2</annotation></semantics></math> pair within each (backbone, regime, column). <span id="A1.T5.9.5" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">Underline</span>: best across all eight rows in the column. Paired two-sided t-tests on per-query scores compare <math id="A1.T5.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S{=}2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S{=}2</annotation></semantics></math> against <math id="A1.T5.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S{=}1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S{=}1</annotation></semantics></math> (pooled across the seven BEIR datasets for the Avg column): <math id="A1.T5.m25" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\dagger" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>†</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\dagger</annotation></semantics></math> <math id="A1.T5.m26" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p&lt;0.05" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p&lt;0.05</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.T5.m27" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ddagger" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>‡</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ddagger</annotation></semantics></math> <math id="A1.T5.m28" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p&lt;0.01" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.01</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p&lt;0.01</annotation></semantics></math>. <math id="A1.T5.m29" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S{=}2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S{=}2</annotation></semantics></math> does not consistently improve over <math id="A1.T5.m30" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S{=}1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S{=}1</annotation></semantics></math> in any configuration.</span></figcaption><div class="ltx_flex_figure">
